From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:04:00 +0100
Subject: Skip the CGI option test without php-cgi

Unlike the other sapi/cgi tests, 005.phpt had no SKIPIF section and
failed when php-cgi is not found next to the CLI binary, as in the Debian
build with one build directory per SAPI.  Backport of the 005.phpt part
of upstream commit 9c6dd46f27b7 (PHP 8.3).
---
 sapi/cgi/tests/005.phpt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sapi/cgi/tests/005.phpt b/sapi/cgi/tests/005.phpt
index 5524758..4bb2727 100644
--- a/sapi/cgi/tests/005.phpt
+++ b/sapi/cgi/tests/005.phpt
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 --TEST--
 using invalid combinations of cmdline options
+--SKIPIF--
+<?php include "skipif.inc"; ?>
 --FILE--
 <?php
 
